WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.387
The chapter's tests number twenty-six.

2
00:00:02.387 --> 00:00:07.503
They compare the constants against the
script, try every rejection the script makes,

3
00:00:07.503 --> 00:00:10.134
cover closure signals and system defaults,

4
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:13.057
check both checkable and
empty intended states,

5
00:00:13.057 --> 00:00:16.346
the three classes a person
decides first, and the tempo,

6
00:00:16.346 --> 00:00:20.438
and accept every payload the drift
client builds from the fixtures.

7
00:00:20.438 --> 00:00:23.875
With the rest of the kit,
including Chapter 9's thirty-two,

8
00:00:23.875 --> 00:00:29.031
a hundred and forty-one Python tests pass,
plus fifteen Node tests of the ServiceNow

9
00:00:29.031 --> 00:00:33.790
scripts and thirty-eight PowerShell
tests, all without a tenant or a network.
